  "operative_text": "SECTION 1 (new §134-): It shall be unlawful for a person to possess a loaded firearm while the person is intoxicated.\nSECTION 1 (new §134-): Any person violating this section shall be guilty of a petty misdemeanor.\nSECTION 1 (new §134-): A person is in possession of a loaded firearm when the person has immediate physical control over a loaded firearm and the person is outside of the person's dwelling as defined in section 703-300; and"
